<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5372/5412.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5372/5412.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5372/5412 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Thursday will be 5392.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the bid/offer rates were 5371/5411, with the official dollar rate 5391 from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5235/5835 after 5232/5832.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
